1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:05,325
Dante: Fun fact. Zombies can't see in the
dark. So we hide in the dark.

2
00:00:05,645 --> 00:00:11,222
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus,
Route twelve. Part ten of ten: the dark.

3
00:00:11,542 --> 00:00:12,861
Priya: Then neither can we.

4
00:00:13,181 --> 00:00:16,108
Dante: Silence. Darkness. Mystery.

5
00:00:16,228 --> 00:00:19,776
Priya: Tripping. Falling. Screaming.

6
00:00:20,096 --> 00:00:21,346
Dante: ...I'm scared of the dark.

7
00:00:21,696 --> 00:00:25,766
Rosa: Safe Zone twelve. The gate. The
lights go out.

8
00:00:26,086 --> 00:00:29,173
Dante: Marcus. Lead us in. In the dark.

9
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:30,595
Marcus: Aggressively cautious.

10
00:00:30,915 --> 00:00:33,361
Marcus: I can't see! I walked into Walt!

11
00:00:33,481 --> 00:00:35,337
Walt: Five more minutes, Margaret.

12
00:00:35,657 --> 00:00:37,718
Teddy: Gary has a flashlight. Gary is
always ready.

13
00:00:38,038 --> 00:00:41,392
Priya: Real rule. Always carry a light and
spare batteries.

14
00:00:41,712 --> 00:00:47,673
Steve: Excuse me. I have a ticket. Is this
Safe Zone twelve?

15
00:00:47,793 --> 00:00:49,507
Rosa: Yes, Steve. Welcome home.

16
00:00:49,827 --> 00:00:51,361
Dante: I'm never leaving the bus again.

17
00:00:51,681 --> 00:00:52,934
June: Bring snacks, dear.

18
00:00:53,281 --> 00:00:57,728
BUS-E: We have arrived. Safe Zone twelve.
Thank you for riding the Last Bus.

19
00:00:58,048 --> 00:01:03,370
BUS-E: Part ten of ten, the end of the
Last Bus, Route twelve. Follow for the next series.

